#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Gym/scripts.inc:259
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_GymGuideAdvice"
msgid ""
"Hey, how's it going, CHAMPION-\n"
"bound {PLAYER}?\p"
"WATTSON, the LEADER of MAUVILLE\n"
"GYM, uses ELECTRIC-type POKéMON.\p"
"If you challenge him with WATER-type\n"
"POKéMON, he'll zap them! Bzzt!\p"
"And, he's put in switch-controlled\n"
"doors all over his GYM! Eccentric!\p"
"Hey, go for it!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Gym/scripts.inc:270
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_GymGuidePostVictory"
msgid ""
"Whoa, you're electrifying!\n"
"You've powered the door open!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Gym/scripts.inc:274
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_KirkIntro"
msgid ""
"My electric soul, it'll shatter your\n"
"dreams whole, whoa-yeahah!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Gym/scripts.inc:278
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_KirkDefeat"
msgid ""
"That was plugged in, amped up,\n"
"over-driven electric, man!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Gym/scripts.inc:282
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_KirkPostBattle"
msgid ""
"POKéMON and rock, it's all about heart,\n"
"whoa-yeah!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Gym/scripts.inc:286
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_ShawnIntro"
msgid ""
"I trained under WATTSON!\n"
"There ain't no way I'll lose easily!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Gym/scripts.inc:290
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_ShawnDefeat"
msgid "Unplugged and turned off…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Gym/scripts.inc:293
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_ShawnPostBattle"
msgid ""
"WATTSON, our GYM LEADER, has been\n"
"around for a long, long time.\p"
"He was battling even before your\n"
"daddy was born, that tough coot.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Gym/scripts.inc:299
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_BenIntro"
msgid ""
"This GYM's got puzzles!\n"
"Isn't it fun?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Gym/scripts.inc:303
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_BenDefeat"
msgid "It's no fun to lose…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Gym/scripts.inc:306
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_BenPostBattle"
msgid ""
"WATTSON says he likes setting up\n"
"little traps with switches.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Gym/scripts.inc:310
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_VivianIntro"
msgid ""
"With my charm and my POKéMON's moves,\n"
"you'll be shocked!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Gym/scripts.inc:314
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_VivianDefeat"
msgid "I'm shocked by your power!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Gym/scripts.inc:317
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_VivianPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I've heard that MAUVILLE was founded\n"
"by WATTSON.\p"
"He was a TRAINER long before we\n"
"became TRAINERS.\l"
"He must know all sorts of things!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Gym/scripts.inc:324
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_AngeloIntro"
msgid "I love shiny things!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Gym/scripts.inc:327
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_AngeloDefeat"
msgid ""
"Oh…\n"
"My eyes are frazzled…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Gym/scripts.inc:331
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_AngeloPostBattle"
msgid ""
"MAUVILLE GYM's WATTSON has a shiny\n"
"forehead. It makes me happy!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Gym/scripts.inc:335
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_WattsonIntro"
msgid ""
"I've given up on my plans to convert\n"
"the city, I have.\p"
"And so, I put my time into making\n"
"door traps in my GYM.\p"
"Oh? Now, what are you doing here?\p"
"What's that? You say you've gotten\n"
"past all my rigged doors?\p"
"Wahahahah!\n"
"Now, that is amusing!\p"
"Then, I, WATTSON, the LEADER of\n"
"MAUVILLE GYM, shall electrify you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Gym/scripts.inc:348
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_WattsonDefeat"
msgid ""
"Wahahahah!\n"
"Fine, I lost!\p"
"You ended up giving me a thrill!\n"
"Take this BADGE!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Gym/scripts.inc:354
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedDynamoBadge"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} received the DYNAMO BADGE\n"
"from WATTSON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Gym/scripts.inc:358
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_ExplainDynamoBadgeTakeThis"
msgid ""
"With the DYNAMO BADGE, POKéMON can\n"
"use ROCK SMASH out of battle.\p"
"And, it will make your POKéMON a little\n"
"bit faster, too.\p"
"Hmm…\n"
"You should take this, too!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Gym/scripts.inc:366
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_ExplainShockWave"
msgid ""
"That TM34 there contains SHOCK WAVE.\p"
"It's a trustworthy move that never\n"
"misses! You can count on it!\p"
"… … … … … …$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Gym/scripts.inc:372
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_RegisteredWattson"
msgid ""
"Registered GYM LEADER WATTSON\n"
"in the POKéNAV.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Gym/scripts.inc:376
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_WattsonPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I swell with optimism, seeing a promising\n"
"young TRAINER like you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Gym/scripts.inc:380
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_WattsonGoForthAndEndeavor"
msgid ""
"Wahahahah!\n"
"Go forth and endeavor, youngster!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Gym/scripts.inc:384
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue"
msgid "MAUVILLE CITY POKéMON GYM$"
msgstr ""

